WEBVTT

00:17:25.447 --> 00:17:31.046
pristojnost, radnu etiku, ljubav -

00:17:31.046 --> 00:17:35.370
a neka se sreća i samopoštovanje
postaraju sami za sebe.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.414
Verujem da kad bismo
svi postupali ovako,

00:17:37.414 --> 00:17:40.955
deca bi i dalje bila u redu,

00:17:40.955 --> 00:17:43.601
a i njihovi bi roditelji,

00:17:43.601 --> 00:17:47.569
moguće u oba slučaja čak i bolje.

00:17:47.569 --> 00:17:49.448
Hvala.

00:17:49.448 --> 00:17:53.448
(Aplauz)